= render 'shared/fun_stuff_page', page_title: 'Board Dimensions', current_page: 'Board Dimensions', page_subtitle: 'Technical specifications and mounting information for all Baldrick boards', document_title: 'Board Dimensions - Fun Stuff', meta: ['Small · medium · large', 'M3 mounting holes', 'Compatibility chart'], toc: board_dimensions_toc do
  p.lead Baldrick Boards are categorised into three board sizes — small, medium, and large — so mounts and accessories stay consistent as we add new controllers.

  .prose
    .callout.info
      span.ic
        svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
          circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
          path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
      div
        span.lbl Important
        p.bd Mounting holes in all our boards are strong M3. Please use the correct hardware for secure mounting.

    section#small
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Small
        | Small boards

      p We've designed the Small boards so they can be hidden inside a small junction or project box.

      .dim-block
        .dim-spec
          h4 Specifications
          ul
            li Category: Small form factor
            li Mounting holes: M3
            li Installation: Hidden installs
            li
              | Mounts:
              = link_to ' Small board STLs', fun_stuff_stls_and_mounts_path(anchor: 'small'), class: 'lnk'
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'dimensions-small.jpeg', alt: 'Small Baldrick Board Dimensions'
          figcaption Small Baldrick board dimensions.

    section#medium
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Medium
        | Medium boards

      p
        | We based the dimensions of the
        strong  medium Baldrick boards
        |  to match similar boards already in the market so you can reuse mounts and 3D printed elements.

      .dim-block
        .dim-spec
          h4 Specifications
          ul
            li Category: Medium form factor
            li Board footprint: 117mm × 74mm
            li Mounting holes: M3
            li Compatibility: Matches similar boards in market
            li
              | Mounts:
              = link_to ' Medium board STLs', fun_stuff_stls_and_mounts_path(anchor: 'medium'), class: 'lnk'
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'dimensions-medium.jpeg', alt: 'Medium Baldrick Board Dimensions'
          figcaption Medium Baldrick board dimensions.

    section#large
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Large
        | Large boards

      p
        | The
        strong  large Baldrick boards
        |  are designed for applications requiring more processing power and connectivity options.

      .dim-block
        .dim-spec
          h4 Specifications
          ul
            li Category: Large form factor
            li Board: Baldrick17
            li Mounting holes: M3
            li Board footprint: 115mm × 180mm
            li
              | Mounts:
              = link_to ' Large board STLs', fun_stuff_stls_and_mounts_path(anchor: 'large'), class: 'lnk'
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'dimensions-large.png', alt: 'Large Baldrick Board Dimensions'
          figcaption Large Baldrick board dimensions.

    .callout.warn
      span.ic
        svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
          path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"
      div
        span.lbl Heads up
        p.bd
          strong DO NOT enlarge the mounting holes.
          |  Use the correct M3 hardware — drilling voids your warranty.

    section#compatibility
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Chart
        | Board compatibility

      .ct-table
        table
          thead
            tr
              th Form factor
              th Boards
          tbody
            tr
              td
                strong Small
              td BaldrickInput1, BaldrickSignals, other compact controllers
            tr
              td
                strong Medium
              td Baldrick8, BaldrickInput8, BaldrickDMX, BaldrickSwitchy
            tr
              td
                strong Large
              td Baldrick17

      .next-grid
        = link_to fun_stuff_stls_and_mounts_path, class: 'next-card' do
          .top
            span.kind Downloads
            span.go →
          h4 STLs & mounts
          p Community-created printable mounts and enclosures.
        = link_to support_path, class: 'next-card' do
          .top
            span.kind Support
            span.go →
          h4 Contact support
          p Mounting or enclosure questions? We're here to help.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Print a mount that fits
    p Grab STLs from the community library and match them to your board size.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to fun_stuff_stls_and_mounts_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | STLs & mounts
        span.ar →
      = link_to boards_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | Explore boards
